\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 7 Margi Murphy, Rachel Metz, and Mark Bergen, AI Startup ElevenLabs Bans Account Blamed for Biden Audio Deepfake, Bloomberg (Jan. 26, 2024).}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0
